[center][color=#58D1B2][size=5][b]Journal Wider[/b][/size][/color]
[color=#F3EEE7]A wider, carefully reflowed Journal layout for Fields of Mistria.[/color][/center]

[color=#58D1B2][size=4][b]About[/b][/size][/color]
[color=#F3EEE7]Journal Wider adds room to both Journal pages and reflows their contents to use it. The goal is simple: more space for names, descriptions, lists, and collection entries, while preserving the game's pixel-art look and familiar Journal structure.[/color]

[color=#58D1B2][size=4][b]What changes[/b][/size][/color]
[list]
[*][color=#F3EEE7]Wider Journal pages with background artwork extended only inside the Journal.[/color]
[*][color=#F3EEE7]Residents / Relationships: wider resident list, relocated scrollbar, and more room for relationship details and gift grids.[/color]
[*][color=#F3EEE7]Player, customization, inventory, quest, animal, spellcasting, map, and Almanac pages receive page-specific layout adjustments where needed.[/color]
[*][color=#F3EEE7]Fixed-size map artwork remains unscaled and is centred in the wider space.[/color]
[*][color=#F3EEE7]Compatibility handling for Mistria Auxiliary Bag's optional Inventory hotbar when that mod is present.[/color]
[/list]

[color=#58D1B2][size=4][b]What it does not change[/b][/size][/color]
[list]
[*][color=#F3EEE7]No translations, font files, or language settings.[/color]
[*][color=#F3EEE7]No game files.[/color]
[*][color=#F3EEE7]No changes outside the Journal interface.[/color]
[/list]

[color=#58D1B2][size=4][b]Installation[/b][/size][/color]
[list]
[*][color=#F3EEE7]Install a current version of Mistria Modding API / your compatible mod manager.[/color]
[*][color=#F3EEE7]Install Journal Wider as a separate mod archive.[/color]
[*][color=#F3EEE7]Open the Journal normally; the layout applies when its pages are opened or rebuilt.[/color]
[/list]

[color=#58D1B2][size=4][b]Compatibility[/b][/size][/color]
[color=#F3EEE7]Journal Wider is layout-only and does not replace localization or font assets. It is designed to coexist with Font Choices and language mods. Other mods that directly rebuild or reposition the same Journal elements may need compatibility testing; please report the mod name, Journal page, and a screenshot if you find an overlap or clipped control.[/color]
